      "parameters": {
        "content": "# NEW: Order handling\nReceive → live lookup / duplicate guards → sync existing lookup table → validate customer/payment/totals → check stock → confirmation → confirmed handoff. Hourly follow-up creates a demo reminder after 24h or human review after 72h.\n\nConfigure both OH config nodes, the new HTTP credentials, and the lookup-table binding. Real confirmation email is disabled until configured.\n\nThe original Logistics code remains mock-based by request. Its HTTP acceptance is not proof of actual fulfillment.\n\nSee MERGE-README.md.",
